  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Knowledge Management Facility for Making Markets work for the Poor (M4P-KMF)&quot; is aimed at stimulating to more effective use of market approaches in support to poverty reduction. The initiative is implemented in cooperation with a number of international donors. The UK (DFID) coordinates the financing and implementation of the programme.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&quot;Knowledge Management Facility for Making Markets work for the Poor (M4P-KMF)&quot; &#xE4;r en internationell kunskapsplattform med syfte att att stimulera till &#xF6;kad och mer effektiv anv&#xE4;ndning av marknadsapproacher i fattigdomsbek&#xE4;mpningen. Initiativet genomf&#xF6;rs i samarbete mellan ett antal internationella givare. Storbritannien (DFID) samordnar finansieringen och genomf&#xF6;randet av programmet.</narrative>
  </description>
